OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening with any showers dying out. A
OL,7,Fdry start to the night but thicker
OL,8,Fcloud and patchy rain will spread
OL,9,Feastwards, eastern Borders will likely
OL,10,Fremain dry.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA mostly cloudy day with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain. Best chance of dry
OL,14,Fand bright spells will be in the east.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,17,FFurther rain spreading east on Monday
OL,18,Fthen bright spells and scattered
OL,19,Fshowers on Tuesday. Showers turning
OL,20,Fheavy and thundery on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
